  "worked_solution": "If we denote\n\n$$\nP(x):x<4,\n$$\n\nour statement can be written as\n\n$$\n\u2203x\\in Z,\\,P(x).\n$$\n\nNegating this, we obtain\n\n$$\n\u00ac(\u2203x\\in Z,\\,P(x))\u2261\u2200x\\in Z,\\,\u00acP(x).\n$$\n\nFinally, $\u2200x\\in Z,\\,\u00acP(x)$ reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $x\\in Z,$ $x\\text{\\boldsymbol}\\ge 4.$",
